WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.232 --> 00:00:01.509
- What the fuck are we doing today?

00:00:01.509 --> 00:00:03.550
You're having me drink water?

00:00:03.877 --> 00:00:06.128
(peppy music)

00:00:19.016 --> 00:00:21.338
- Smells like hydrogen and oxygen.

00:00:21.338 --> 00:00:23.614
- The consistency looks like water.

00:00:23.614 --> 00:00:27.282
- It's like a metal-y,
bottle-y kind of taste to it.

00:00:27.282 --> 00:00:28.768
- Tastes like water.

00:00:28.768 --> 00:00:30.045
- Since it just makes me thirstier,

00:00:30.045 --> 00:00:31.369
I'm gonna say it's expensive.

00:00:31.369 --> 00:00:32.482
- And I think it's cheap.

00:00:32.482 --> 00:00:33.203
- Will I drink this?

00:00:33.203 --> 00:00:35.011
Yes, because it is the life source

00:00:35.011 --> 00:00:36.884
that runs the planet.

00:00:36.884 --> 00:00:38.440
- And this was Dasani.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:39.879
- They charge you so much,

00:00:39.879 --> 00:00:41.156
it is such a rip-off.

00:00:41.156 --> 00:00:43.362
It's made by the biggest
soda company in the world.

00:00:43.362 --> 00:00:45.103
There's something evil about that, right?

00:00:45.103 --> 00:00:46.411
Like I'm not crazy?

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:51.951
- The way it splashes
really reminds me of water.

00:00:55.595 --> 00:00:57.015
- I like this water.

00:00:57.015 --> 00:00:58.872
- This just, it tastes like water,

00:00:58.872 --> 00:01:01.032
which is what I want from my water.

00:01:01.032 --> 00:01:02.680
- Expensive?

00:01:02.680 --> 00:01:04.444
Like spa water?

00:01:04.444 --> 00:01:05.465
- I bet this one's expensive,

00:01:05.465 --> 00:01:07.277
now that I'm talking all
this good stuff about it.

00:01:07.277 --> 00:01:08.761
This is Fiji.

00:01:10.099 --> 00:01:12.307
- I love Arrowhead!

00:01:12.307 --> 00:01:13.445
- This is what I'm talking about,

00:01:13.445 --> 00:01:14.815
this is just the normal stuff.

00:01:14.815 --> 00:01:16.626
Arrowhead, it's water, dummy.

00:01:16.626 --> 00:01:17.690
Just drink it.

00:01:21.619 --> 00:01:22.804
- What?

00:01:22.804 --> 00:01:24.136
Is that water?

00:01:24.136 --> 00:01:25.529
- I don't have any problems with it.

00:01:25.529 --> 00:01:27.201
- This is like your
older brother's holding

00:01:27.201 --> 00:01:29.569
your head underwater in a pool,

00:01:29.569 --> 00:01:32.913
and you take just one little
gasp of air, desperately,

00:01:32.913 --> 00:01:34.654
but all you get is chlorine.

00:01:34.654 --> 00:01:36.256
- Oh, I don't like this one.

00:01:36.256 --> 00:01:37.417
It's super filmy.

00:01:37.417 --> 00:01:38.718
- Dumb expensive water that they

00:01:38.718 --> 00:01:40.610
throw some PH shit in.

00:01:41.749 --> 00:01:42.806
- Delish!

00:01:42.806 --> 00:01:44.826
"Iceland pure spring water

00:01:44.826 --> 00:01:47.566
"with a PH of 8.88."

00:01:47.566 --> 00:01:48.944
- Added PH!

00:01:48.944 --> 00:01:51.222
- Guys, my water palate
is pretty on point, right?

00:01:57.338 --> 00:01:58.569
- So I know it's not cheap

00:01:58.569 --> 00:02:00.589
because there's no metal aftertaste.

00:02:00.589 --> 00:02:02.656
- Top of the taste, refreshing.

00:02:02.656 --> 00:02:05.163
End of the taste, a little tap water-y.

00:02:05.163 --> 00:02:06.533
- Fiji maybe?

00:02:06.533 --> 00:02:07.880
- I don't know, something about it

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:10.127
tastes like it's seen some pipes.

00:02:10.127 --> 00:02:10.758
- Cheap.

00:02:10.758 --> 00:02:11.778
- You would still drink it,

00:02:11.778 --> 00:02:14.247
but you'd have more fun
spraying it on your lawn.

00:02:14.247 --> 00:02:16.940
- I would say like 1.50 a bottle?

00:02:16.940 --> 00:02:19.494
- Ha, suck it Fiji!

00:02:19.494 --> 00:02:21.955
- This is Fiji water?

00:02:21.955 --> 00:02:24.587
- That's upsetting,
because it looks so pretty.

00:02:27.714 --> 00:02:29.455
- Oh, this one looks fancy!

00:02:29.455 --> 00:02:31.011
This one is fancy water!

00:02:31.011 --> 00:02:32.520
- Oh my God,

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:34.584
I just know from the smell,

00:02:34.584 --> 00:02:37.224
I don't even need to taste this thing.

00:02:39.130 --> 00:02:40.377
- That's tap water.

00:02:40.377 --> 00:02:42.553
- This is pool water,

00:02:42.553 --> 00:02:45.440
a.k.a. Los Angeles tap water.

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.568
- Because everyone knows
L.A. water is disgusting.

00:02:47.568 --> 00:02:49.954
- If somebody sells this,
they should be ashamed.

00:02:49.954 --> 00:02:51.691
- I now want to go back and revise

00:02:51.691 --> 00:02:53.293
all my other answers, because I was like,

00:02:53.293 --> 00:02:54.663
"There's not a difference in water."

00:02:54.663 --> 00:02:55.731
No, there's a difference.

00:02:55.731 --> 00:02:56.938
This is not good water.

00:02:56.938 --> 00:02:57.893
- [Voiceover] Yeah, it's tap water.

00:02:57.893 --> 00:02:58.630
- (laughs)

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:00.232
- No, you should not pay more for water.

00:03:00.232 --> 00:03:02.461
If you're paying for this
designer brand bottle,

00:03:02.461 --> 00:03:03.691
just know what you're paying for

00:03:03.691 --> 00:03:05.595
is that fancy, cool looking design.

00:03:05.595 --> 00:03:07.383
No one has any right to
be snobbish about water,

00:03:07.383 --> 00:03:09.241
it's one of the most
essential things in the world,

00:03:09.241 --> 00:03:10.448
we are lucky to have it,

00:03:10.448 --> 00:03:12.048
just drink it.

